  "jp": "渡り頸仕口",
  "gloss": "",
  "guidance": "A crossing lap: each 90 mm beam is halved where the two cross, so the upper beam's 頸 straddles the lower beam and the pair sit on the post without a mortise in the post itself. 下山 recommends 渡りあご for a 90 mm+ joist because it fixes the joist without damaging the beam.",
